{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game now fully support English, Japanese and Chinese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use both Controller and Keyboard to play the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive with your Fluffy Friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this 3D Survivor-like Action Roguelite game,\u00a0you will Control adorable animals,</strong><br><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat swarms of enemies and Tame them to your Royal Companions! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utilize the Skill Evolution and</strong>\u00a0<strong>Skill</strong>\u00a0<strong>Enchantment system, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine 20+ skills and 70+ Enchantment Cards to forge your unique builds!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/1f1fbe415bcf1abe7d9611df2aee74ea.avif?t=1772717183\" width=600 height=117 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast and Horde-Clearing Combat\uff01</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into fast-paced, <strong>15-minute 3D battles</strong> where you <strong>sweep out thousands of enemies</strong> at once!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the screen fill with damage numbers as enemy hordes melt before your storm of skills!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/bf83889fd202cc26949c19051d5396e6.poster.avif?t=1772717183\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/bf83889fd202cc26949c19051d5396e6.webm?t=1772717183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/bf83889fd202cc26949c19051d5396e6.mp4?t=1772717183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/70b382a832e16bfd38a486139e95a275.avif?t=1772717183\" width=600 height=116 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill Evolution + Skill Enchantment = Infinite Possibilities\u221e</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine 20+ Unique Skills</strong> with <strong>70+ Enchantment Cards</strong> to fundamentally change how you fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a simple Tornado into a screen-clearing Firestorm, or make your Summons split into an army!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>1,000+ Combinations</strong>, experiment to find your own <strong>Game-Breaking Synergy</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/eb76f2c15d3826990c9a919ed36869b6.poster.avif?t=1772717183\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/eb76f2c15d3826990c9a919ed36869b6.webm?t=1772717183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/eb76f2c15d3826990c9a919ed36869b6.mp4?t=1772717183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/cf0dbcae5b791f87217bd99ed9093be6.avif?t=1772717183\" width=600 height=114 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Foe to Friend: Tame Them All\uff01</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every monster you see\u2014from goofy minions to terrifying Boss can be tamed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the <strong>30+ enemy types</strong> for a chance to add them to your squad.<br>Build your very own <strong>&quot;Fluffy Army&quot;</strong> and never fight alone again!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/66b7cbd2f5c9c896c005516bd9f2bc03.poster.avif?t=1772717183\" width=562 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/66b7cbd2f5c9c896c005516bd9f2bc03.webm?t=1772717183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/66b7cbd2f5c9c896c005516bd9f2bc03.mp4?t=1772717183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/f517f0802cc194369d9f1c336c254b84.avif?t=1772717183\" width=600 height=114 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full 3D Immersive Experience\uff01</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle between <strong>Immersive 3D Third-Person View</strong> and <strong>Classic Top-Down View at any time!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom in to feel the adrenaline of close-quarters combat and the scale of the swarm, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom out for a tactical overhead view to plan your battle strategy perfectly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http