tras/4051c5b0870720f4814b2b245d20a6da.mp4?t=1772717183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the quick, build-focused loops of <strong>survivor/roguelite games</strong>, this one\u2019s for you\u2014and if you want extra cuteness, bring the pets along!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Explorer of the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043830/74beb2b80ee8465865b57877f8e7850af8e0f9da.jpg"},{"name":"Conqueror of the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043830/29bd7ea4205b057afc6716c09958eeab2a0a3c5e.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043830/b5583f6e92c0a6cccf90c792c466c48e37301079.jpg"},{"name":"Legend of the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043830/59bdf7f906af969626e988074b43b600e161d65b.jpg"},{"name":"Forest Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043830/5be2226a9ba4f32fbd8819595847fa68264e437b.jpg"},{"name":"Adventurer of the Turnipa Kingdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043830/89d6efc4f5572f37aab7002a5638f85d0df5213a.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer of the Turnipa Kingdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043830/4c96d64f2cbf9be74dc152d2c4534d82f97592dc.jpg"},{"name":"Conqueror of the Turnipa Kingdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043830/1ee4d3405bf2ca328c95824657c4765286081bd5.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Turnipa Kingdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043830/6fd831dc9e82046a8e5eaf3498aee8dd23fe0d3e.jpg"},{"name":"Legend of the Turnipa Kingdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommu